# What gets uploaded when deploying from this machine.
#
# Deny everything, then allow back only the licence server. Written as an
# allow-list on purpose: this directory also holds WhatsApp credentials, a
# database of real messages, and outreach files full of real names and phone
# numbers. A deny-list would need updating every time something new appears,
# and the cost of forgetting once is uploading someone's private messages to a
# build server.
*

!Dockerfile
!railway.json
!server/
!server/package.json
!server/licence-server.js
!server/razorpay-webhook.js

# Belt and braces: even if an allow rule above is ever loosened, these must
# never leave this machine.
data/
outreach/
dist/
node_modules/
*.db
*.log
